  "headline": "FDA shortage list shows Padagis US LLC scopolamine transdermal system to be discontinued as of 2025-11-03; our label names Zydus Lifesciences Limited with VAI inspections in 2013-09-21 and 2024-07-19",
  "headline_cites": ["E7", "E6", "E4", "E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list records Padagis US LLC scopolamine transdermal system as To Be Discontinued with an initial posting date of 2025-11-03.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label in our system names Zydus Lifesciences Limited as the labeler and plant (FEI 3008957483) for NDC 70771178704.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that FEI show a VAI classification on 2013-09-21 (known 2014-03-05) and another VAI on 2024-07-19 (known 2024-09-30).",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current on‑hand supply across our three sites ranges from 10 to 17 days on hand at present usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based best option is to buy from A‑S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether A‑S Medication Solutions can provide a label that identifies a registered manufacturing plant and verify its inspection history before committing.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
